      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The results of a combination of functional electrocardiographic tests were compared with those of a WHO questionnaire for angina of effort. Coronary disease was verified in 37% of patients with a double diagnosis of angina of effort, and in 100% of cases of angina of effort combined with ischemic electrocardiographic changes."},
